      "hizbQuarter": 28,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 457,
      "text": "Allah conferred favor on the believers when He sent them a messenger from among themselves, reciting to them His verses, purifying them, and teaching them the Book and Wisdom[77], although before that they were clearly misguided.",
